{"parse":{"title":"个性/自由的意志","pageid":5409,"revid":13089,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E5%BF%97&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E5%BF%97&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E5%BF%97&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>自由的意志</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E8.87.AA.E7.94.B1.E7.9A.84.E6.84.8F.E5.BF.97\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"自由的意志\"><b>自由的意志</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"个性 自由的意志.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/29/7fy2tgvkiy2pulw9zfy1xy7zd2d7pxy.png/80px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E5%BF%97.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/29/7fy2tgvkiy2pulw9zfy1xy7zd2d7pxy.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E7%9A%84%E6%84%8F%E5%BF%97.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/2/29/7fy2tgvkiy2pulw9zfy1xy7zd2d7pxy.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />自由的意志\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自由意志\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">自由意志</font></span></span>]时，移动力增加<font color=\"red\">1</font>格。战斗开始时，获得<font color=\"red\">6</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自由意志\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">自由意志</font></span></span>]；行动结束时，获得<font color=\"red\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自由意志\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">自由意志</font></span></span>]。拥有额外技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">自由的召唤</span>]，消耗<font color=\"red\">8</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自由意志\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">自由意志</font></span></span>]、<font color=\"red\">2</font>点能量可使用。\n<br />&#160;技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">自由的召唤</span>]，效果：瞬发，单体治疗，治疗量为物攻值的<font color=\"red\">30%</font>，并使其获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自由之姿1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">自由之姿1</font></span></span>]，每回合最多触发1次。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8D%97%E5%A8%9C%C2%B7%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91\" title=\"角色图鉴库/伊南娜·铃兰之剑\"><img alt=\"头像 伊南娜·铃兰之剑.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/95/7xf56pp71w2r9qrvn7pxbqra09q6el9.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">伊南娜·铃兰之剑</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>攻防属性提升<font color=\"red\">10%</font>，拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自由意志\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">自由意志</font></span></span>]时，移动力增加<font color=\"red\">1</font>格。战斗开始时，获得<font color=\"red\">8</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中